SUMMARY:Dinner: Crispy Chickpea & Broccoli Rice Bowls
DESCRIPTION:Crispy roasted chickpeas and broccoli over rice.\n\nServes 2\n\
 nIngredients:\n- 1 can (15 oz) chickpeas\, drained\, rinsed\, patted dry\n
 - 1.5 lb broccoli\, cut into florets\n- 2 tbsp olive oil\n- 1 tsp ground c
 umin\n- 1 tsp smoked paprika\n- 1/2 tsp garlic powder\n- Salt and pepper\,
  to taste\n- 1.5 cups cooked white rice\n- 1 lime\, juiced\n\nInstructions
 :\n1. Preheat oven to 425F.\n2. Toss chickpeas and broccoli with olive oil
 \, cumin\, smoked paprika\, garlic powder\, salt\, and pepper.\n3. Spread 
 on a sheet pan and roast 20-25 minutes\, stirring once\, until chickpeas a
 re crisp and broccoli is lightly charred.\n4. Divide rice between bowls\, 
 top with the roasted chickpeas and broccoli\, and finish with a squeeze of
  lime.\n5. Kevin: add sliced pan-seared chicken breast for extra protein.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
