SUMMARY:Dinner: Black Bean & Sweet Potato Tacos with Charred Cauliflower
DESCRIPTION:Black bean and sweet potato tacos with charred cauliflower.\n\n
 Serves 2\n\nIngredients:\n- 1 large sweet potato\, peeled and diced small\
 n- 1 can (15 oz) black beans\, drained and rinsed\n- 1/2 head cauliflower\
 , cut into small florets\n- 2 tbsp olive oil\n- 1 tsp ground cumin\n- 1/2 
 tsp mild chili powder\n- Salt\, to taste\n- 6 small corn or flour tortilla
 s\n- 1 avocado\, sliced\n- Lime wedges and chopped cilantro\, to serve\n\n
 Instructions:\n1. Preheat oven to 425F. Toss sweet potato and cauliflower 
 with olive oil\, cumin\, chili powder\, and salt.\n2. Roast 25-30 minutes\
 , stirring halfway\, until tender and lightly charred.\n3. Warm the black 
 beans in a small pot with a splash of water over low heat.\n4. Warm the to
 rtillas\, then fill with roasted sweet potato\, cauliflower\, black beans\
 , avocado\, and cilantro.\n5. Serve with lime wedges.\n6. Kevin: add a sea
 red protein of your choice (chicken\, steak\, or shrimp) for extra protein
 .
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
