SUMMARY:Dinner: Chickpea Pasta with White Beans\, Peas & Spinach
DESCRIPTION:Chickpea pasta tossed with white beans\, peas\, and spinach.\n\
 nServes 2\n\nIngredients:\n- 8 oz chickpea pasta (or whole wheat pasta)\n-
  1 can (15 oz) white (cannellini) beans\, drained and rinsed\n- 1 cup froz
 en peas\n- 3 cups fresh spinach\n- 2 tbsp olive oil\n- 3 cloves garlic\, m
 inced\n- Juice of 1/2 lemon\n- Salt and pepper\, to taste\n- Parmesan\, to
  finish (optional)\n\nInstructions:\n1. Cook pasta according to package di
 rections\; reserve 1/2 cup pasta water before draining.\n2. While pasta co
 oks\, heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add garlic and c
 ook 30 seconds until fragrant.\n3. Add white beans and peas\, cook 3-4 min
 utes until warmed through.\n4. Add spinach and cook until just wilted\, ab
 out 2 minutes.\n5. Toss in the cooked pasta with a splash of the reserved 
 pasta water\, lemon juice\, salt\, and pepper.\n6. Top with parmesan if us
 ing.\n7. Kevin: stir in ricotta or top with grilled chicken for extra prot
 ein.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
