SUMMARY:Dinner: Quinoa Bowls with Roasted Broccoli\, Red Pepper & Feta
DESCRIPTION:Quinoa bowls with roasted broccoli\, red pepper\, and feta.\n\n
 Serves 2\n\nIngredients:\n- 1 cup quinoa\, rinsed\n- 2 cups broccoli flore
 ts\n- 1 red bell pepper\, sliced\n- 2 tbsp olive oil\n- 1/2 tsp garlic pow
 der\n- Salt and pepper\, to taste\n- 4 oz feta cheese\, crumbled\n- Juice 
 of 1/2 lemon\n\nInstructions:\n1. Cook quinoa according to package directi
 ons (about 2 cups water to 1 cup quinoa\, simmer 15 minutes).\n2. Preheat 
 oven to 425F. Toss broccoli and red pepper with olive oil\, garlic powder\
 , salt\, and pepper.\n3. Roast 20 minutes until tender and lightly charred
 .\n4. Divide quinoa between bowls\, top with roasted vegetables\, crumbled
  feta\, and a squeeze of lemon.\n5. Kevin: top with grilled flank steak.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
