SUMMARY:Dinner: Loaded Sweet Potatoes with Spiced Chickpeas & Yogurt
DESCRIPTION:Loaded sweet potatoes topped with spiced chickpeas and yogurt.\
 n\nServes 2\n\nIngredients:\n- 2 large sweet potatoes\n- 1 can (15 oz) chi
 ckpeas\, drained and patted dry\n- 1 tbsp olive oil\n- 1/2 tsp ground cumi
 n\n- 1/2 tsp smoked paprika\n- 1/4 tsp garlic powder\n- Salt\, to taste\n-
  1/2 cup plain yogurt\n- Chopped scallions or parsley\, to garnish\n\nInst
 ructions:\n1. Preheat oven to 425F. Pierce sweet potatoes with a fork and 
 bake 45-50 minutes until tender.\n2. Toss chickpeas with olive oil\, cumin
 \, smoked paprika\, garlic powder\, and salt.\n3. Roast the chickpeas on a
  sheet pan for the last 20 minutes alongside the sweet potatoes\, until cr
 isp.\n4. Split the sweet potatoes open\, top with the spiced chickpeas\, a
  dollop of yogurt\, and scallions or parsley.\n5. Kevin: add crumbled cook
 ed Italian sausage on top.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
