SUMMARY:Dinner: White Bean\, Spinach & Lemon Soup
DESCRIPTION:A bright\, brothy soup with white beans\, spinach\, and lemon.\
 n\nServes 2\n\nIngredients:\n- 2 tbsp olive oil\n- 1 small onion\, diced\n
 - 2 cloves garlic\, minced\n- 2 cans (15 oz each) white (cannellini) beans
 \, drained and rinsed\n- 4 cups vegetable broth\n- 3 cups fresh spinach\n-
  Juice and zest of 1 lemon\n- Salt and pepper\, to taste\n- Parmesan\, to 
 finish (optional)\n\nInstructions:\n1. Heat olive oil in a large pot over 
 medium heat. Saute onion until soft\, about 5 minutes. Add garlic\, cook 1
  minute.\n2. Add white beans and vegetable broth. Simmer 15 minutes.\n3. W
 ith an immersion blender\, lightly blend about half the soup for a creamie
 r texture\, leaving some beans whole.\n4. Stir in spinach until just wilte
 d\, then add lemon juice and zest. Season with salt and pepper.\n5. Top wi
 th parmesan if using.\n6. Kevin: add shredded rotisserie chicken for extra
  protein.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
